# Generated scan output. Scoped to the repository root on purpose: the bare
# pattern "report.*" also matched sarbar/report.py and sarbar/policies/report.yaml,
# which silently kept them out of the repository — anyone installing from GitHub
# would have got a package that cannot produce a report.
/report.html
/report.json
/report.sarif
/report.txt
/report.xml

# SPEC.md is the internal engineering log: session-by-session decisions, dead
# ends and measurements. It is deliberately not part of the published project,
# where it would be noise for a reader who only wants to use the tool. It stays
# on disk for the author and is never committed.
SPEC.md